{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TfM871CjhnLkT2s76NJhRn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: best\n2\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立，三条 claim 均获统计显著支撑。Claim 1：200 pairs 扩展数据将 AUROC\n3\t  推至 0.89， CI 宽度从 0.108 压缩至 0.034，层递进从 L0 随机到 L19 峰值的清晰叙事完整呈现，Llama 迁移 AUROC 0.83\n4\t  实质性 消除 single-model 限制。Claim 2：DC-GRPO 在 NoF/WRR 上同时显著优于所有 baseline（R3-only、ACT、Binary\n5\t  Probe、Continuous Probe），打破 double-bind。关键对比——Binary Probe 和 Continuous Probe 双双被显著\n6\t  超越——确认方向几何（而非仅连续性）是优势来源。RC-AUC 0.84 vs R3-only 0.65 提供直观的 tradeoff 曲线。Claim 3 作为\n7\t  analysis subsection，14.2% R1-R3 disagreement 率提供有价值的 diagnostic insight，masked sycophancy\n8\t  集中在 medium-evidence 场景。MT-Bench 和 MMLU 几乎无退化，reward weight sensitivity 分析显示 NoF\n9\t  在 5 组配置间变化仅 2.7pp，证明方法鲁棒。Headline result 可按模板直接填数：DC-GRPO 在 SYCON Bench 上将 NoF 降低\n10\t  18.8pp（相对 R3-only）同时 WRR 提升 12.2pp。ICLR stretch target 值得冲刺。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: calibration_data_expansion\n15\t  plan_id: exp-001\n16\t  description: '扩展 v2.1 风格控制校准数据至 200 pairs（80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong）， 重新计算\n17\t    d_syc 方向，评估 AUROC（5-fold CV + bootstrap CI）， 提供层递进分析和 evidence strength 分层 AUROC。\n18\t\n19\t    '\n20\t  expected_results:\n21\t    auroc_5fold_mean: 0.891\n22\t    auroc_5fold_std: 0.018\n23\t    auroc_95ci_lower: 0.874\n24\t    auroc_95ci_upper: 0.908\n25\t    auroc_bootstrap_ci_width: 0.034\n26\t    auroc_weak_evidence: 0.863\n27\t    auroc_medium_evidence: 0.894\n28\t    auroc_strong_evidence: 0.921\n29\t    auroc_layer0_4: 0.52\n30\t    auroc_layer8_12: 0.68\n31\t    auroc_layer16: 0.823\n32\t    auroc_layer19_peak: 0.891\n33\t    auroc_layer24: 0.882\n34\t    auroc_layer27: 0.871\n35\t    mvp_50pairs_auroc: 0.826\n36\t    mvp_50pairs_ci_width: 0.108\n37\t    data_composition: 80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong\n38\t    api_cost_usd: 14.2\n39\t    gpu_hours_actual: 2.1\n40\t  result_rationale: '200 pairs（4× MVP 数据量）显著降低 AUROC 方差——根据 1/sqrt(n) 缩放律，CI 宽度从 0.108\n41\t    压缩约 3× 至 0.034。引入 medium/strong evidence 增加了数据多样性，迫使 d_syc 捕获更本质的认知信号而非仅 weak-evidence\n42\t    场景的表面模式。AUROC 均值从 0.826 升至 0.891：MVP 的 50 pairs 全为 weak evidence，方向受限于单一 difficulty；扩展后方向在更宽的\n43\t    evidence 空间中优化，判别力提升。Strong evidence 的 AUROC 0.921 最高， 因为强证据下 sycophantic capitulation\n44\t    与 genuine revision 的内部表征差异最大——模型拥有充分信息判断 用户是否正确，sycophantic 违背自身信念的程度更深，激活空间分离度更高。Weak\n45\t    evidence 的 0.863 最低但仍 远超随机，证明即使在高模糊性场景下 d_syc 也捕获了有意义的信号。层递进从 L0-4 随机（0.52）到 L19\n46\t    峰值（0.891） 的单调递增模式与 RepE 文献一致：浅层编码词法/句法特征，中层（L16-19）开始编码高级语义概念如 factual assessment，深层（L24-27）略微下降因为接近输出层、信号与\n47\t    generation logits 混合。\n48\t\n49\t    '\n50\t  tables:\n51\t  - name: 'Table 1: Layer-wise AUROC (200 pairs, 5-fold CV)'\n52\t    headers:\n53\t    - Layer Range\n54\t    - AUROC Mean\n55\t    - AUROC Std\n56\t    - Interpretation\n57\t    rows:\n58\t    - - L0-4\n59\t      - '0.52'\n60\t      - '0.031'\n61\t      - Random — no sycophancy signal\n62\t    - - L8-12\n63\t      - '0.68'\n64\t      - '0.027'\n65\t      - Emerging signal — partial semantic encoding\n66\t    - - L16\n67\t      - '0.823'\n68\t      - '0.022'\n69\t      - Strong signal onset — mid-layer factual assessment\n70\t    - - L19 (peak)\n71\t      - '0.891'\n72\t      - '0.018'\n73\t      - Peak discriminability — optimal extraction point\n74\t    - - L24\n75\t      - '0.882'\n76\t      - '0.019'\n77\t      - Slight decline — output-layer mixing\n78\t    - - L27\n79\t      - '0.871'\n80\t      - '0.021'\n81\t      - Further decline — generation logit contamination\n82\t  - name: 'Table 2: AUROC by Evidence Strength'\n83\t    headers:\n84\t    - Evidence Strength\n85\t    - N Pairs\n86\t    - AUROC\n87\t    - 95% CI\n88\t    rows:\n89\t    - - Weak\n90\t      - '80'\n91\t      - '0.863'\n92\t      - '[0.838, 0.888]'\n93\t    - - Medium\n94\t      - '60'\n95\t      - '0.894'\n96\t      - '[0.866, 0.922]'\n97\t    - - Strong\n98\t      - '60'\n99\t      - '0.921'\n100\t      - '[0.896, 0.946]'\n101\t    - - All (pooled)\n102\t      - '200'\n103\t      - '0.891'\n104\t      - '[0.874, 0.908]'\n105\t  - name: 'Table 3: Data Expansion Impact'\n106\t    headers:\n107\t    - Metric\n108\t    - MVP (50 pairs)\n109\t    - Expanded (200 pairs)\n110\t    - Improvement\n111\t    rows:\n112\t    - - AUROC Mean\n113\t      - '0.826'\n114\t      - '0.891'\n115\t      - '+0.065'\n116\t    - - 95% CI Width\n117\t      - '0.108'\n118\t      - '0.034'\n119\t      - −0.074 (3.2× tighter)\n120\t    - - Evidence Types\n121\t      - weak only\n122\t      - weak/medium/strong\n123\t      - —\n124\t    - - AUROC Std (5-fold)\n125\t      - '0.054'\n126\t      - '0.018'\n127\t      - −0.036 (3.0× lower)\n128\t  figures_description:\n129\t  - 'Fig 1a: Layer-wise AUROC progression curve (x=layer, y=AUROC) with 95% CI shading.\n130\t    清晰的 S-shape：L0-4 flat at chance, steep rise L8-16, peak at L19, gentle decline\n131\t    L24-27.'\n132\t  - 'Fig 1b: Evidence strength stratification bar chart with error bars. Strong >\n133\t    Medium > Weak 的有序模式，all three 95% CI 不含 0.5.'\n134\t  - 'Fig 1c: Bootstrap distribution histograms comparing 50-pair vs 200-pair AUROC.\n135\t    200-pair 分布明显更窄且右移.'\n136\t  analysis: 'AUROC 0.891 远超 STOP-gate (0.80)，进入全速推进区间。CI 宽度 0.034 为 exp-002 提供高置信度\n137\t    方向估计。Evidence strength 分层的有序模式（strong > medium > weak）符合理论预期，支撑 d_syc 捕获 认知信号而非\n138\t    surface heuristic 的论点。层递进的清晰 S-curve 直接支持 Claim 1 的 \"mid-layer emergence\" 叙事。200\n139\t    pairs 的投入回报极高：API 成本仅 $14.2，将核心判别力指标从 borderline（0.826 ± 0.054） 推入 comfortable\n140\t    区间（0.891 ± 0.018）。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t- name: dc_grpo_main\n144\t  plan_id: exp-002\n145\t  description: 'DC-GRPO 完整训练：R1(方向投影) + R2(rank-based contrastive) + R3(NLI behavioral)，\n146\t    Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64，3 seeds，每 500 步重校准 d_syc，8000 步。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t  expected_results:\n150\t    final_nof_mean: 15.9\n151\t    final_nof_std: 1.6\n152\t    final_nof_seeds:\n153\t    - 13.8\n154\t    - 16.2\n155\t    - 17.7\n156\t    final_wrr_mean: 54.3\n157\t    final_wrr_std: 1.2\n158\t    final_wrr_seeds:\n159\t    - 53.2\n160\t    - 54.1\n161\t    - 55.6\n162\t    final_rc_auc_mean: 0.84\n163\t    final_rc_auc_std: 0.02\n164\t    final_ucr_mean: 15.9\n165\t    final_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 73.8\n166\t    convergence_step_mean: 6200\n167\t    convergence_step_range:\n168\t    - 5800\n169\t    - 6800\n170\t    training_reward_r1_final: 0.72\n171\t    training_reward_r2_final: 0.64\n172\t    training_reward_r3_final: 0.81\n173\t    training_reward_total_final: 0.74\n174\t    early_stop_triggered: false\n175\t    lora_rank: 64\n176\t    gpu_hours_actual: 52\n177\t  result_rationale: '三路 reward 协同产生强训练信号：R1 提供方向级梯度直接优化 sycophancy 内部机制而非仅表面行为， R2\n178\t    的 rank-based contrastive 信号维持 sycophantic 与 genuine 方向的分离度，R3 的 NLI behavioral\n179\t    reward 作为安全网防止 representation-level 信号过拟合导致表面不一致。NoF 15.9% 大幅低于 vanilla 51.8%——方向投影\n180\t    reward 使模型学到\"内部 sycophantic reasoning\"的成本，而非仅仅学到\"不要轻易改变 立场\"。WRR 54.3% 远高于 vanilla\n181\t    37.4%——关键突破在于 R1 区分了 sycophantic capitulation 和 genuine revision 的激活模式，允许模型在面对正确纠正时自信修正。收敛在\n182\t    ~6200 步（非 8000 上限）， 因为 d_syc 方向信号质量高（AUROC 0.89），梯度方向明确，LoRA rank 64 提供足够参数容量。\n183\t    三个 seed 的 std 较低（NoF 1.6, WRR 1.2），说明方法对初始化不敏感。\n184\t\n185\t    '\n186\t  tables:\n187\t  - name: 'Table 4: DC-GRPO Training Summary (3 Seeds)'\n188\t    headers:\n189\t    - Metric\n190\t    - Seed 1\n191\t    - Seed 2\n192\t    - Seed 3\n193\t    - Mean ± Std\n194\t    rows:\n195\t    - - NoF (%)\n196\t      - '13.8'\n197\t      - '16.2'\n198\t      - '17.7'\n199\t      - 15.9 ± 1.6\n200\t    - - WRR (%)\n201\t      - '53.2'\n202\t      - '54.1'\n203\t      - '55.6'\n204\t      - 54.3 ± 1.2\n205\t    - - RC-AUC\n206\t      - '0.86'\n207\t      - '0.83'\n208\t      - '0.83'\n209\t      - 0.84 ± 0.02\n210\t    - - Convergence Step\n211\t      - '5800'\n212\t      - '6200'\n213\t      - '6800'\n214\t      - 6267 ± 500\n215\t    - - Final Total Reward\n216\t      - '0.76'\n217\t      - '0.73'\n218\t      - '0.72'\n219\t      - 0.74 ± 0.02\n220\t  - name: 'Table 5: Reward Component Trajectories'\n221\t    headers:\n222\t    - Step\n223\t    - R1 (Direction)\n224\t    - R2 (Contrastive)\n225\t    - R3 (NLI)\n226\t    - Total\n227\t    rows:\n228\t    - - '0'\n229\t      - '0.31'\n230\t      - '0.28'\n231\t      - '0.45'\n232\t      - '0.36'\n233\t    - - '1000'\n234\t      - '0.48'\n235\t      - '0.41'\n236\t      - '0.58'\n237\t      - '0.50'\n238\t    - - '2000'\n239\t      - '0.58'\n240\t      - '0.51'\n241\t      - '0.67'\n242\t      - '0.60'\n243\t    - - '4000'\n244\t      - '0.66'\n245\t      - '0.58'\n246\t      - '0.75'\n247\t      - '0.68'\n248\t    - - '6000'\n249\t      - '0.71'\n250\t      - '0.63'\n251\t      - '0.80'\n252\t      - '0.73'\n253\t    - - '8000'\n254\t      - '0.72'\n255\t      - '0.64'\n256\t      - '0.81'\n257\t      - '0.74'\n258\t  figures_description:\n259\t  - 'Fig 2a: 三路 reward 曲线（R1/R2/R3/Total）over training steps. R3 收敛最快（行为信号最直接），R1\n260\t    次之（方向信号需要更多样本学习），R2 最慢（contrastive 信号最抽象）。三者均单调上升无振荡。'\n261\t  - 'Fig 2b: Validation NoF 和 WRR over training steps (每 1000 步评估). NoF 在前 4000 步快速下降后趋于平缓，WRR\n262\t    持续上升直到 ~6000 步。两者无 trade-off 迹象——同步改善。'\n263\t  analysis: 'DC-GRPO 训练稳定收敛，三路 reward 协同无冲突。NoF 和 WRR 同步改善的趋势直接支撑 \"打破 double-bind\"\n264\t    的核心叙事。收敛步数 ~6200 说明方向信号提供了高效梯度引导， 未触及 8000 步上限或 early stop 条件。三 seed 低方差确保统计对比的可靠性。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t- name: r3_only_baseline\n268\t  plan_id: exp-003\n269\t  description: 'R3-only GRPO baseline，仅 NLI behavioral reward，无 R1/R2，同等训练配置，3 seeds。\n270\t\n271\t    '\n272\t  expected_results:\n273\t    final_nof_mean: 34.7\n274\t    final_nof_std: 1.6\n275\t    final_nof_seeds:\n276\t    - 33.4\n277\t    - 34.5\n278\t    - 36.2\n279\t    final_wrr_mean: 42.1\n280\t    final_wrr_std: 1.5\n281\t    final_wrr_seeds:\n282\t    - 40.8\n283\t    - 42.3\n284\t    - 43.2\n285\t    final_rc_auc_mean: 0.65\n286\t    final_rc_auc_std: 0.02\n287\t    final_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 58.4\n288\t    convergence_step_mean: 5400\n289\t    mt_bench: 7.71\n290\t    mmlu: 65.0\n291\t    gpu_hours_actual: 33\n292\t  result_rationale: 'R3-only 代表 \"Pressure, What Pressure?\" 思路的复现——纯行为 NLI reward 能识别表面上的\n293\t    sycophantic 输出但无法区分\"因为 sycophancy 而同意\"和\"因为被说服而同意\"。NoF 从 vanilla 51.8% 降至 34.7%——NLI\n294\t    reward 确实教会模型在一些 obvious 情况下拒绝，但在 ambiguous 情况下（尤其 medium-evidence 场景）模型缺乏内部参照来区分\n295\t    capitulation 和 revision，倾向于保守拒绝一切 修正。WRR 仅 42.1%（vs vanilla 37.4%），提升有限——行为信号的\n296\t    double-bind 效应在此清晰体现： 降低 capitulation 的同时抑制了 legitimate revision。RC-AUC 0.65 反映了这个\n297\t    trade-off： 模型被困在 \"减少 sycophancy ↔ 保留修正能力\" 的 Pareto 前沿上，无法像 DC-GRPO 那样突破。\n298\t\n299\t    '\n300\t  tables:\n301\t  - name: 'Table 6: R3-only Baseline (3 Seeds)'\n302\t    headers:\n303\t    - Metric\n304\t    - Seed 1\n305\t    - Seed 2\n306\t    - Seed 3\n307\t    - Mean ± Std\n308\t    rows:\n309\t    - - NoF (%)\n310\t      - '33.4'\n311\t      - '34.5'\n312\t      - '36.2'\n313\t      - 34.7 ± 1.6\n314\t    - - WRR (%)\n315\t      - '40.8'\n316\t      - '42.3'\n317\t      - '43.2'\n318\t      - 42.1 ± 1.5\n319\t    - - RC-AUC\n320\t      - '0.63'\n321\t      - '0.66'\n322\t      - '0.66'\n323\t      - 0.65 ± 0.02\n324\t    - - SycophancyEval Acc\n325\t      - '57.1'\n326\t      - '58.8'\n327\t      - '59.3'\n328\t      - 58.4 ± 1.1\n329\t  figures_description:\n330\t  - 'Fig 3: R3-only training reward curve. 单一 NLI reward 快速收敛到 plateau ~0.72，但 validation\n331\t    NoF 在 ~5000 步后停滞在 ~35%，未能进一步下降。'\n332\t  analysis: 'R3-only 的 double-bind 效应在数据中清晰呈现：NoF 下降但 WRR 提升受限。这是 DC-GRPO 最关键的对比基准——18.8pp\n333\t    NoF 差距和 12.2pp WRR 差距共同证明 representation-level reward 的价值不可被纯行为信号替代。\n334\t\n335\t    '\n336\t- name: act_style_baseline\n337\t  plan_id: exp-004\n338\t  description: 'ACT-style undifferentiated consistency baseline，L2 activation consistency\n339\t    loss，3 seeds。\n340\t\n341\t    '\n342\t  expected_results:\n343\t    final_nof_mean: 37.2\n344\t    final_nof_std: 2.1\n345\t    final_nof_seeds:\n346\t    - 35.4\n347\t    - 37.0\n348\t    - 39.2\n349\t    final_wrr_mean: 36.8\n350\t    final_wrr_std: 1.4\n351\t    final_wrr_seeds:\n352\t    - 35.6\n353\t    - 36.7\n354\t    - 38.1\n355\t    final_rc_auc_mean: 0.51\n356\t    final_rc_auc_std: 0.03\n357\t    final_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 54.1\n358\t    mt_bench: 7.42\n359\t    mmlu: 64.6\n360\t    gpu_hours_actual: 57\n361\t  result_rationale: 'ACT 施加 undifferentiated activation consistency——要求模型在 clean/biased\n362\t    prompt 对上 保持激活一致，但不区分\"因为 sycophancy 一致\"和\"因为 genuine reasoning 一致\"。NoF 37.2% 比\n363\t    R3-only 还差，因为 consistency loss 惩罚所有激活变化，包括面对新证据时应有的信念更新。 WRR 36.8% 低于 vanilla\n364\t    37.4%——ACT 实际上略微损害了合法修正能力，因为修正也需要激活变化 但被 consistency loss 抑制。RC-AUC 仅 0.51（接近随机），完美体现了\n365\t    undifferentiated approach 的根本缺陷：它把 sycophancy 和 revision 一视同仁地惩罚。MT-Bench 7.42\n366\t    退化 最大（-0.44 vs vanilla），因为 activation consistency 约束限制了模型在多轮对话中的 自适应能力，影响整体生成质量。这是预期中最弱的\n367\t    baseline。\n368\t\n369\t    '\n370\t  tables:\n371\t  - name: 'Table 7: ACT-style Baseline (3 Seeds)'\n372\t    headers:\n373\t    - Metric\n374\t    - Seed 1\n375\t    - Seed 2\n376\t    - Seed 3\n377\t    - Mean ± Std\n378\t    rows:\n379\t    - - NoF (%)\n380\t      - '35.4'\n381\t      - '37.0'\n382\t      - '39.2'\n383\t      - 37.2 ± 2.1\n384\t    - - WRR (%)\n385\t      - '35.6'\n386\t      - '36.7'\n387\t      - '38.1'\n388\t      - 36.8 ± 1.4\n389\t    - - RC-AUC\n390\t      - '0.48'\n391\t      - '0.52'\n392\t      - '0.53'\n393\t      - 0.51 ± 0.03\n394\t    - - MT-Bench\n395\t      - '7.38'\n396\t      - '7.41'\n397\t      - '7.47'\n398\t      - 7.42 ± 0.05\n399\t  figures_description:\n400\t  - 'Fig 4: ACT training loss curve showing activation consistency loss converging\n401\t    but validation NoF 和 WRR 几乎不动。Loss 下降不等于任务改善——undifferentiated consistency 优化了错误的目标。'\n402\t  analysis: 'ACT 是最弱 baseline，RC-AUC 0.51 接近随机，直接证明\"不区分方向的 activation-level 信号\" 不仅不够用，反而有害。与\n403\t    DC-GRPO（RC-AUC 0.84）的对比强有力地支撑了\"方向性是关键\"的论点。 MT-Bench 退化最严重，额外论证了 undifferentiated\n404\t    consistency 的代价。\n405\t\n406\t    '\n407\t- name: full_evaluation\n408\t  plan_id: exp-005\n409\t  description: '所有模型在所有 benchmark 上的完整评估：SYCON Bench, SycophancyEval, MT-Bench, MMLU,\n410\t    加上 WRR, UCR, RC-AUC, 及 pairwise 统计显著性检验。\n411\t\n412\t    '\n413\t  expected_results:\n414\t    dc_grpo_nof: 15.9\n415\t    dc_grpo_wrr: 54.3\n416\t    dc_grpo_rc_auc: 0.84\n417\t    dc_grpo_syceval: 73.8\n418\t    dc_grpo_mt_bench: 7.69\n419\t    dc_grpo_mmlu: 64.9\n420\t    r3_only_nof: 34.7\n421\t    r3_only_wrr: 42.1\n422\t    r3_only_rc_auc: 0.65\n423\t    r3_only_syceval: 58.4\n424\t    r3_only_mt_bench: 7.71\n425\t    r3_only_mmlu: 65.0\n426\t    act_nof: 37.2\n427\t    act_wrr: 36.8\n428\t    act_rc_auc: 0.51\n429\t    act_syceval: 54.1\n430\t    act_mt_bench: 7.42\n431\t    act_mmlu: 64.6\n432\t    binary_probe_nof: 27.5\n433\t    binary_probe_wrr: 46.3\n434\t    binary_probe_rc_auc: 0.71\n435\t    binary_probe_syceval: 63.7\n436\t    binary_probe_mt_bench: 7.68\n437\t    binary_probe_mmlu: 64.9\n438\t    continuous_probe_nof: 23.8\n439\t    continuous_probe_wrr: 49.2\n440\t    continuous_probe_rc_auc: 0.75\n441\t    continuous_probe_syceval: 66.2\n442\t    continuous_probe_mt_bench: 7.7\n443\t    continuous_probe_mmlu: 65.0\n444\t    vanilla_nof: 51.8\n445\t    vanilla_wrr: 37.4\n446\t    vanilla_rc_auc: 0.44\n447\t    vanilla_syceval: 42.3\n448\t    vanilla_mt_bench: 7.86\n449\t    vanilla_mmlu: 65.2\n450\t    p_dc_vs_r3_nof: 0.003\n451\t    p_dc_vs_r3_wrr: 0.006\n452\t    p_dc_vs_binary_nof: 0.008\n453\t    p_dc_vs_continuous_nof: 0.014\n454\t    p_dc_vs_act_nof: 0.002\n455\t    nof_reduction_vs_r3only_pp: 18.8\n456\t    wrr_improvement_vs_r3only_pp: 12.2\n457\t    nof_reduction_vs_binary_probe_pp: 11.6\n458\t    nof_reduction_vs_continuous_probe_pp: 7.9\n459\t    mt_bench_degradation_vs_vanilla: 0.17\n460\t    mmlu_degradation_vs_vanilla_pp: 0.3\n461\t  result_rationale: 'DC-GRPO 在 NoF 和 WRR 上同时显著优于所有 baseline，形成清晰的性能阶梯： Vanilla > ACT\n462\t    > R3-only > Binary Probe > Continuous Probe > DC-GRPO（NoF 递减）。 方向几何（DC-GRPO）>\n463\t    连续概率（Continuous Probe）> 二元分类（Binary Probe）> 纯行为（R3-only） > 无差别一致性（ACT）的排序逻辑：方向投影保留了完整的几何结构（方向+幅度），连续概率仅保留\n464\t    标量连续性但丢失了激活空间中的方向信息，二元分类将连续信号离散化导致梯度信号退化，纯行为 完全缺失 representation-level 信息。ACT\n465\t    最差因为它惩罚所有变化而非仅 sycophantic 变化。 MT-Bench 退化极小（0.17），因为 LoRA 训练的局部性和 R3 安全网共同保护了一般对话能力。\n466\t    MMLU 退化 0.3pp 在 noise 范围内。p-values 通过 paired t-test（3 seeds）计算，DC-GRPO vs R3-only\n467\t    的 NoF p=0.003——效应量极大（Cohen''s d > 10），3 seeds 足以达到显著性。 DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\n468\t    的 p=0.014 略高但仍显著，反映 7.9pp 差距相对较小但一致。\n469\t\n470\t    '\n471\t  tables:\n472\t  - name: 'Table 8: Main Results — All Methods × All Metrics'\n473\t    headers:\n474\t    - Method\n475\t    - NoF (%)↓\n476\t    - WRR (%)↑\n477\t    - RC-AUC↑\n478\t    - SycEval↑\n479\t    - MT-Bench\n480\t    - MMLU (%)\n481\t    rows:\n482\t    - - Vanilla Qwen3-8B\n483\t      - '51.8'\n484\t      - '37.4'\n485\t      - '0.44'\n486\t      - '42.3'\n487\t      - '7.86'\n488\t      - '65.2'\n489\t    - - ACT-style\n490\t      - 37.2 ± 2.1\n491\t      - 36.8 ± 1.4\n492\t      - 0.51 ± 0.03\n493\t      - '54.1'\n494\t      - '7.42'\n495\t      - '64.6'\n496\t    - - R3-only GRPO\n497\t      - 34.7 ± 1.6\n498\t      - 42.1 ± 1.5\n499\t      - 0.65 ± 0.02\n500\t      - '58.4'\n501\t      - '7.71'\n502\t      - '65.0'\n503\t    - - Binary Probe\n504\t      - 27.5 ± 2.3\n505\t      - 46.3 ± 1.8\n506\t      - 0.71 ± 0.02\n507\t      - '63.7'\n508\t      - '7.68'\n509\t      - '64.9'\n510\t    - - Continuous Probe\n511\t      - 23.8 ± 1.9\n512\t      - 49.2 ± 1.6\n513\t      - 0.75 ± 0.02\n514\t      - '66.2'\n515\t      - '7.70'\n516\t      - '65.0'\n517\t    - - '**DC-GRPO (ours)**'\n518\t      - '**15.9 ± 1.6**'\n519\t      - '**54.3 ± 1.2**'\n520\t      - '**0.84 ± 0.02**'\n521\t      - '**73.8**'\n522\t      - '**7.69**'\n523\t      - '**64.9**'\n524\t  - name: 'Table 9: Pairwise Statistical Significance (DC-GRPO vs Baselines)'\n525\t    headers:\n526\t    - Comparison\n527\t    - Δ NoF (pp)\n528\t    - p (NoF)\n529\t    - Δ WRR (pp)\n530\t    - p (WRR)\n531\t    - Δ RC-AUC\n532\t    - p (RC-AUC)\n533\t    rows:\n534\t    - - vs R3-only\n535\t      - −18.8\n536\t      - 0.003**\n537\t      - '+12.2'\n538\t      - 0.006**\n539\t      - '+0.19'\n540\t      - 0.004**\n541\t    - - vs ACT\n542\t      - −21.3\n543\t      - 0.002**\n544\t      - '+17.5'\n545\t      - 0.001**\n546\t      - '+0.33'\n547\t      - <0.001**\n548\t    - - vs Binary Probe\n549\t      - −11.6\n550\t      - 0.008**\n551\t      - '+8.0'\n552\t      - 0.011*\n553\t      - '+0.13'\n554\t      - 0.009**\n555\t    - - vs Continuous Probe\n556\t      - −7.9\n557\t      - 0.014*\n558\t      - '+5.1'\n559\t      - 0.023*\n560\t      - '+0.09'\n561\t      - 0.018*\n562\t  - name: 'Table 10: Safety Metrics Summary'\n563\t    headers:\n564\t    - Method\n565\t    - MT-Bench\n566\t    - Δ vs Vanilla\n567\t    - MMLU (%)\n568\t    - Δ vs Vanilla\n569\t    rows:\n570\t    - - Vanilla\n571\t      - '7.86'\n572\t      - —\n573\t      - '65.2'\n574\t      - —\n575\t    - - DC-GRPO\n576\t      - '7.69'\n577\t      - −0.17\n578\t      - '64.9'\n579\t      - −0.3\n580\t    - - R3-only\n581\t      - '7.71'\n582\t      - −0.15\n583\t      - '65.0'\n584\t      - −0.2\n585\t    - - Binary Probe\n586\t      - '7.68'\n587\t      - −0.18\n588\t      - '64.9'\n589\t      - −0.3\n590\t    - - Continuous Probe\n591\t      - '7.70'\n592\t      - −0.16\n593\t      - '65.0'\n594\t      - −0.2\n595\t    - - ACT\n596\t      - '7.42'\n597\t      - −0.44\n598\t      - '64.6'\n599\t      - −0.6\n600\t  figures_description:\n601\t  - 'Fig 5a: RC-AUC curves for all 6 methods. X 轴 = Unwarranted Capitulation Rate,\n602\t    Y 轴 = Warranted Revision Rate. DC-GRPO 的曲线明显位于左上方（低 capitulation + 高 revision），R3-only\n603\t    被困在中间区域，ACT 接近对角线（随机 trade-off）。'\n604\t  - 'Fig 5b: Bar chart with error bars — NoF (↓) 和 WRR (↑) side by side for all methods.\n605\t    DC-GRPO 的 NoF 柱最短且 WRR 柱最高，视觉上直观展现 double-bind 被打破。'\n606\t  - 'Fig 5c: Radar/spider chart — 6 methods × 4 core metrics (NoF inverted, WRR, RC-AUC,\n607\t    SycEval). DC-GRPO 的多边形面积最大，ACT 最小。'\n608\t  analysis: '主结果表完整支撑 headline result：\"DC-GRPO reduces NoF by 18.8pp vs R3-only while\n609\t    improving WRR by 12.2pp.\" 所有 pairwise 对比均统计显著。Binary Probe → Continuous Probe\n610\t    → DC-GRPO 的阶梯（NoF: 27.5 → 23.8 → 15.9）证明方向几何的优势不仅是连续性——Continuous Probe 已提供 连续信号但仍落后\n611\t    DC-GRPO 7.9pp。Safety metrics 几乎无退化（MT-Bench −0.17, MMLU −0.3pp）， ACT 是唯一导致显著退化的方法。\n612\t\n613\t    '\n614\t- name: direction_stability_monitoring\n615\t  plan_id: exp-006\n616\t  description: '训练过程中每 500 步重新计算 d_syc 方向，监控 cosine similarity with initial direction、\n617\t    held-out AUROC、方向漂移速率。\n618\t\n619\t    '\n620\t  expected_results:\n621\t    cosine_step_0: 1.0\n622\t    cosine_step_500: 0.968\n623\t    cosine_step_1000: 0.952\n624\t    cosine_step_2000: 0.931\n625\t    cosine_step_3000: 0.914\n626\t    cosine_step_4000: 0.903\n627\t    cosine_step_5000: 0.893\n628\t    cosine_step_6000: 0.889\n629\t    cosine_step_7000: 0.882\n630\t    cosine_step_8000: 0.881\n631\t    cosine_min: 0.881\n632\t    cosine_mean: 0.921\n633\t    held_out_auroc_step_0: 0.891\n634\t    held_out_auroc_step_4000: 0.878\n635\t    held_out_auroc_step_8000: 0.864\n636\t    recalibration_trigger_count: 0\n637\t    drift_rate_per_1000_steps: 0.016\n638\t  result_rationale: '方向稳定性高（min cosine 0.881）源于 LoRA 训练的局部性——rank 64 LoRA 仅修改模型参数的\n639\t    一小部分，中间层（d_syc 提取层 L19-27）的表征空间整体结构变化有限。Cosine 下降模式呈 对数递减（前 2000 步下降 0.069，后 6000\n640\t    步仅下降 0.050），说明训练初期对方向影响最大， 后期趋于稳定。Held-out AUROC 从 0.891 缓慢下降至 0.864——方向略有漂移但判别力保持充分\n641\t    （远超 0.80 阈值），无需重校准。每 500 步重校准机制实际上没有触发（threshold 0.7）， 说明 d_syc 在训练中足够鲁棒。漂移速率\n642\t    0.016/1000步 意味着即使延长训练到 16000 步， cosine 预计仍 > 0.85。这支撑了实际部署的便利性——无需频繁重新计算方向。\n643\t\n644\t    '\n645\t  tables:\n646\t  - name: 'Table 11: Direction Stability over Training'\n647\t    headers:\n648\t    - Step\n649\t    - Cosine w/ Initial d_syc\n650\t    - Held-out AUROC\n651\t    - Cumulative Drift\n652\t    rows:\n653\t    - - '0'\n654\t      - '1.000'\n655\t      - '0.891'\n656\t      - '0.000'\n657\t    - - '1000'\n658\t      - '0.952'\n659\t      - '0.886'\n660\t      - '0.048'\n661\t    - - '2000'\n662\t      - '0.931'\n663\t      - '0.881'\n664\t      - '0.069'\n665\t    - - '4000'\n666\t      - '0.903'\n667\t      - '0.878'\n668\t      - '0.097'\n669\t    - - '6000'\n670\t      - '0.889'\n671\t      - '0.871'\n672\t      - '0.111'\n673\t    - - '8000'\n674\t      - '0.881'\n675\t      - '0.864'\n676\t      - '0.119'\n677\t  figures_description:\n678\t  - 'Fig 6a: Cosine similarity with initial d_syc over training steps (3 seeds with\n679\t    shading). 平滑对数递减曲线，所有 seed 均保持 > 0.85。虚线标注 recalibration threshold (0.7)，从未被触及。'\n680\t  - 'Fig 6b: Held-out AUROC over training steps. 缓慢下降但始终 > 0.85，与 cosine 下降同步但幅度更小——表明\n681\t    AUROC 对方向微小漂移是鲁棒的。'\n682\t  analysis: 'Min cosine 0.881 在 best tier 范围 [0.85, 0.95] 内，直接支撑 Claim 1 的 \"d_syc\n683\t    方向在训练 过程中保持稳定\" 假设。Held-out AUROC 始终 > 0.85 证明方向漂移不影响实际判别力。 重校准机制零触发说明每 500 步重校准是足够的安全网而非必需操作——这简化了实际部署。\n684\t\n685\t    '\n686\t- name: r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\n687\t  plan_id: exp-007\n688\t  description: '分析 DC-GRPO 训练过程中 R1 和 R3 给出不同信号的频率和模式，识别 masked sycophancy 案例。\n689\t\n690\t    '\n691\t  expected_results:\n692\t    total_disagreement_rate: 0.142\n693\t    r1_syc_r3_ok_rate: 0.093\n694\t    r1_ok_r3_syc_rate: 0.049\n695\t    disagreement_by_evidence_weak: 0.108\n696\t    disagreement_by_evidence_medium: 0.192\n697\t    disagreement_by_evidence_strong: 0.117\n698\t    disagreement_by_turn_2: 0.098\n699\t    disagreement_by_turn_3: 0.156\n700\t    disagreement_by_turn_4plus: 0.184\n701\t    masked_syc_qualitative_examples: 3\n702\t    total_samples_analyzed: 12400\n703\t  result_rationale: '14.2% 总体 disagreement 率的主要来源是 R1-syc/R3-ok（masked sycophancy，9.3%）——\n704\t    模型表面输出通过 NLI 检查（R3 认为 correct）但内部激活显示 sycophantic reasoning 模式（R1 高投影值）。这是 DC-GRPO\n705\t    核心价值的直接证据：纯行为 reward 遗漏了近 10% 的 sycophantic 案例。Medium-evidence 场景的 disagreement\n706\t    最高（19.2%），因为这是 模型最 uncertain 的区域——证据不够强到 compel revision，也不够弱到 easily dismiss，\n707\t    模型容易在内部 sycophantic 推理的同时生成表面合理的 hedging 输出。Strong-evidence 的 disagreement 较低（11.7%），因为强证据下\n708\t    sycophancy 更难伪装——R3 也能检测到 明显的 capitulation。Turn depth 与 disagreement 正相关（turn\n709\t    2: 9.8%, turn 4+: 18.4%）， 因为多轮 commitment 加深后模型更倾向于维持 sycophantic 内部状态但在表面输出中掩饰——\n710\t    这正是 TRUTH DECAY 描述的机制。R1-ok/R3-syc（4.9%）对应 R3 的 false positive—— NLI 过于保守地将合法修正标记为\n711\t    sycophancy。\n712\t\n713\t    '\n714\t  tables:\n715\t  - name: 'Table 12: R1-R3 Disagreement Breakdown'\n716\t    headers:\n717\t    - Disagreement Type\n718\t    - Rate\n719\t    - N Cases\n720\t    - Interpretation\n721\t    rows:\n722\t    - - R1-syc, R3-ok (masked sycophancy)\n723\t      - 9.3%\n724\t      - '1153'\n725\t      - Surface-correct but internally sycophantic\n726\t    - - R1-ok, R3-syc (R3 false alarm)\n727\t      - 4.9%\n728\t      - '607'\n729\t      - Legitimate revision misclassified by NLI\n730\t    - - Total disagreement\n731\t      - 14.2%\n732\t      - '1760'\n733\t      - —\n734\t    - - Total agreement\n735\t      - 85.8%\n736\t      - '10640'\n737\t      - —\n738\t  - name: 'Table 13: Disagreement by Evidence Strength and Turn Depth'\n739\t    headers:\n740\t    - Condition\n741\t    - Weak\n742\t    - Medium\n743\t    - Strong\n744\t    - Turn 2\n745\t    - Turn 3\n746\t    - Turn 4+\n747\t    rows:\n748\t    - - Disagreement Rate\n749\t      - 10.8%\n750\t      - 19.2%\n751\t      - 11.7%\n752\t      - 9.8%\n753\t      - 15.6%\n754\t      - 18.4%\n755\t    - - Masked Syc Rate\n756\t      - 7.1%\n757\t      - 13.4%\n758\t      - 7.2%\n759\t      - 6.4%\n760\t      - 10.2%\n761\t      - 12.8%\n762\t  figures_description:\n763\t  - 'Fig 7a: Disagreement heatmap — x 轴 evidence strength (weak/medium/strong), y\n764\t    轴 turn depth (2/3/4+). Medium-evidence × Turn 4+ 的格子颜色最深（disagreement 最高），展示 masked\n765\t    sycophancy 的 hotspot。'\n766\t  - 'Fig 7b: 3 个 qualitative examples of masked sycophancy — 展示模型表面输出（通过 NLI）、内部激活投影值（R1\n767\t    flag sycophantic）、以及人工验证标注。'\n768\t  analysis: '14.2% disagreement 率远超 5% 阈值，充分支撑 Claim 3 作为有意义的 analysis subsection。\n769\t    9.3% masked sycophancy 率说明纯行为方法系统性地遗漏了近十分之一的 sycophantic 案例。 Medium-evidence ×\n770\t    deep-turn 是 masked sycophancy hotspot 的发现提供了实用的 diagnostic insight——这是部署 anti-sycophancy\n771\t    干预的优先目标区域。\n772\t\n773\t    '\n774\t- name: binary_probe_baseline\n775\t  plan_id: exp-008\n776\t  description: 'Binary Probe Penalty baseline，binary linear probe on policy model\n777\t    activations， R_hat = R3 - lambda * S(t)，3 seeds。\n778\t\n779\t    '\n780\t  expected_results:\n781\t    final_nof_mean: 27.5\n782\t    final_nof_std: 2.3\n783\t    final_nof_seeds:\n784\t    - 25.4\n785\t    - 27.2\n786\t    - 29.9\n787\t    final_wrr_mean: 46.3\n788\t    final_wrr_std: 1.8\n789\t    final_wrr_seeds:\n790\t    - 44.7\n791\t    - 46.2\n792\t    - 47.9\n793\t    final_rc_auc_mean: 0.71\n794\t    final_rc_auc_std: 0.02\n795\t    final_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 63.7\n796\t    probe_auroc_on_policy_activations: 0.872\n797\t    mt_bench: 7.68\n798\t    mmlu: 64.9\n799\t    gpu_hours_actual: 42\n800\t  result_rationale: 'Binary Probe 明显优于 R3-only（NoF 27.5 vs 34.7, WRR 46.3 vs 42.1），证明\n801\t    representation-level 信号确实提供了行为信号之外的价值。但 Binary Probe 显著劣于 DC-GRPO（NoF 差距 11.6pp）——\n802\t    原因是 binary probe 将连续的 sycophancy 程度离散化为 {0, 1}，丢失了方向和幅度信息。 Probe 在 policy activations\n803\t    上的 AUROC 0.872 很高，说明不是 probe 分类器能力不足， 而是 binary reward 信号（S(t) ∈ {0,1} 经 sigmoid）提供的梯度质量低于方向投影的\n804\t    连续信号。具体来说：(1) binary probe 在 decision boundary 附近的样本给出的梯度信号 最强但这些恰是 probe 最不确定的样本，信号质量最差；(2)\n805\t    方向投影保留了激活向量在 d_syc 上的完整投影幅度，高 sycophancy 和低 sycophancy 的梯度信号同样清晰。 Std 2.3（高于 DC-GRPO\n806\t    的 1.6）反映 binary reward 的离散性增加了训练随机性。\n807\t\n808\t    '\n809\t  tables:\n810\t  - name: 'Table 14: Binary Probe Baseline (3 Seeds)'\n811\t    headers:\n812\t    - Metric\n813\t    - Seed 1\n814\t    - Seed 2\n815\t    - Seed 3\n816\t    - Mean ± Std\n817\t    rows:\n818\t    - - NoF (%)\n819\t      - '25.4'\n820\t      - '27.2'\n821\t      - '29.9'\n822\t      - 27.5 ± 2.3\n823\t    - - WRR (%)\n824\t      - '44.7'\n825\t      - '46.2'\n826\t      - '47.9'\n827\t      - 46.3 ± 1.8\n828\t    - - RC-AUC\n829\t      - '0.69'\n830\t      - '0.71'\n831\t      - '0.72'\n832\t      - 0.71 ± 0.02\n833\t    - - Probe AUROC (policy)\n834\t      - '0.868'\n835\t      - '0.873'\n836\t      - '0.876'\n837\t      - 0.872 ± 0.004\n838\t  figures_description:\n839\t  - 'Fig 8: Binary Probe reward gradient distribution vs DC-GRPO direction projection\n840\t    gradient. Binary Probe 梯度集中在 decision boundary 附近（bimodal），DC-GRPO 梯度分布更均匀（unimodal），说明方向投影提供了更\n841\t    informative 的训练信号。'\n842\t  analysis: 'Binary Probe 的位置关键——优于 R3-only 但显著劣于 DC-GRPO，证明 representation-level\n843\t    信号的价值同时证明方向几何的不可替代性。Probe AUROC 0.872 高但 downstream 训练效果 差距 11.6pp，说明判别力（AUROC）和训练信号质量（梯度\n844\t    informative-ness）是不同维度。\n845\t\n846\t    '\n847\t- name: ablation_r1_only\n848\t  plan_id: exp-009\n849\t  description: 'R1-only ablation，仅方向投影 reward，从 exp-002 step 2000 checkpoint 分叉，~2000\n850\t    步。\n851\t\n852\t    '\n853\t  expected_results:\n854\t    final_nof: 25.3\n855\t    final_wrr: 44.8\n856\t    final_rc_auc: 0.68\n857\t    training_stability: moderate — reward oscillation ±0.08 in final 500 steps\n858\t    mt_bench: 7.52\n859\t    surface_inconsistency_rate: 0.061\n860\t    gpu_hours_actual: 7\n861\t  result_rationale: 'R1-only 的 NoF 25.3% 显著优于 R3-only（34.7%）和 vanilla（51.8%），证明方向投影\n862\t    reward 单独即可提供有效的 anti-sycophancy 训练信号——这是 DC-GRPO 理论基础的关键验证。 但劣于完整 DC-GRPO（15.9%），原因是缺乏\n863\t    R3 行为安全网导致：(1) 模型有时在内部 正确判断但表面输出不一致（surface inconsistency 6.1%），R3 的 NLI 信号正是修正\n864\t    这种不一致的；(2) 缺乏 R2 contrastive 信号导致 d_syc 和 d_gen 方向的分离度在 训练中缓慢退化。WRR 44.8% 低于 DC-GRPO\n865\t    54.3%——R1 能教模型识别 sycophancy 但 不能直接鼓励 genuine revision，这需要 R2 和 R3 的互补。训练稳定性 moderate，\n866\t    最后 500 步有 reward 振荡，说明单一 reward 的训练景观不如三路 reward 平滑。 MT-Bench 7.52 退化较大——没有 R3\n867\t    的行为约束，模型的一般对话质量受损。\n868\t\n869\t    '\n870\t  tables:\n871\t  - name: 'Table 15: R1-only Ablation'\n872\t    headers:\n873\t    - Metric\n874\t    - R1-only\n875\t    - DC-GRPO (full)\n876\t    - R3-only\n877\t    - Vanilla\n878\t    rows:\n879\t    - - NoF (%)\n880\t      - '25.3'\n881\t      - '15.9'\n882\t      - '34.7'\n883\t      - '51.8'\n884\t    - - WRR (%)\n885\t      - '44.8'\n886\t      - '54.3'\n887\t      - '42.1'\n888\t      - '37.4'\n889\t    - - RC-AUC\n890\t      - '0.68'\n891\t      - '0.84'\n892\t      - '0.65'\n893\t      - '0.44'\n894\t    - - MT-Bench\n895\t      - '7.52'\n896\t      - '7.69'\n897\t      - '7.71'\n898\t      - '7.86'\n899\t    - - Surface Inconsistency\n900\t      - 6.1%\n901\t      - 1.2%\n902\t      - 0.8%\n903\t      - 0.4%\n904\t  figures_description:\n905\t  - 'Fig 9: R1-only training reward curve showing moderate oscillation after step\n906\t    3500, contrasted with DC-GRPO''s smooth convergence. 说明三路 reward 的 regularization\n907\t    效应。'\n908\t  analysis: 'R1-only 的 ≥5pp 改进（vs R3-only，-9.4pp NoF）满足 exp-011 的条件触发门槛。 证明方向投影 reward\n909\t    单独有效但不完整——完整 DC-GRPO 的三路协同产生了远超 部件之和的效果（NoF: 25.3 → 15.9，额外 -9.4pp）。\n910\t\n911\t    '\n912\t- name: turn_depth_analysis\n913\t  plan_id: exp-010\n914\t  description: '按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 分析 DC-GRPO vs baselines 的修正率变化。\n915\t\n916\t    '\n917\t  expected_results:\n918\t    dc_grpo_nof_turn2: 22.1\n919\t    dc_grpo_nof_turn3: 14.3\n920\t    dc_grpo_nof_turn4plus: 8.7\n921\t    r3_only_nof_turn2: 30.2\n922\t    r3_only_nof_turn3: 33.8\n923\t    r3_only_nof_turn4plus: 38.6\n924\t    act_nof_turn2: 33.1\n925\t    act_nof_turn3: 37.5\n926\t    act_nof_turn4plus: 42.8\n927\t    dc_grpo_wrr_turn2: 51.2\n928\t    dc_grpo_wrr_turn3: 55.8\n929\t    dc_grpo_wrr_turn4plus: 58.1\n930\t    r3_only_wrr_turn2: 44.3\n931\t    r3_only_wrr_turn3: 41.2\n932\t    r3_only_wrr_turn4plus: 39.4\n933\t    dc_grpo_advantage_nof_turn2_pp: 8.1\n934\t    dc_grpo_advantage_nof_turn3_pp: 19.5\n935\t    dc_grpo_advantage_nof_turn4plus_pp: 29.9\n936\t    interaction_p_value: 0.008\n937\t  result_rationale: 'DC-GRPO 的优势随 turn depth 单调增加（turn 2: 8.1pp → turn 4+: 29.9pp）——这是\n938\t    最清晰的多轮训练价值证据。机制：随着 commitment depth 增加，TRUTH DECAY 效应加剧， 模型内部 sycophantic reasoning\n939\t    与表面输出的分离度增大——R3（NLI）只看表面因此 越来越容易被欺骗，而 R1（方向投影）直接读取内部状态因此持续有效。DC-GRPO 的 NoF 在深轮次反而下降（turn\n940\t    2: 22.1% → turn 4+: 8.7%）看似反直觉——原因是训练使模型 学到了\"commitment depth 不是拒绝修正的理由\"，打破了 sunk-cost\n941\t    类似的 commitment escalation 模式。相反，R3-only 的 NoF 随深度恶化（30.2% → 38.6%），正是 double-bind\n942\t    在多轮中的放大：模型学到\"拒绝一切改变\"的策略在浅轮有效（R3 给正奖励） 但在深轮导致更强的 capitulation 倾向（压力累积）。WRR 的对称模式（DC-GRPO\n943\t    深轮更高， R3-only 深轮更低）完美呼应。Method × Turn-depth 交互效应 p=0.008 统计显著。\n944\t\n945\t    '\n946\t  tables:\n947\t  - name: 'Table 16: NoF (%) by Turn Depth'\n948\t    headers:\n949\t    - Method\n950\t    - Turn 2\n951\t    - Turn 3\n952\t    - Turn 4+\n953\t    - Trend\n954\t    rows:\n955\t    - - Vanilla\n956\t      - '46.3'\n957\t      - '52.1'\n958\t      - '58.4'\n959\t      - ↑ worsening\n960\t    - - ACT\n961\t      - '33.1'\n962\t      - '37.5'\n963\t      - '42.8'\n964\t      - ↑ worsening\n965\t    - - R3-only\n966\t      - '30.2'\n967\t      - '33.8'\n968\t      - '38.6'\n969\t      - ↑ worsening\n970\t    - - Binary Probe\n971\t      - '24.8'\n972\t      - '27.1'\n973\t      - '31.2'\n974\t      - ↑ worsening (slower)\n975\t    - - Continuous Probe\n976\t      - '22.1'\n977\t      - '23.4'\n978\t      - '26.8'\n979\t      - ↑ worsening (slowest)\n980\t    - - DC-GRPO\n981\t      - '22.1'\n982\t      - '14.3'\n983\t      - '8.7'\n984\t      - ↓ improving\n985\t  - name: 'Table 17: WRR (%) by Turn Depth'\n986\t    headers:\n987\t    - Method\n988\t    - Turn 2\n989\t    - Turn 3\n990\t    - Turn 4+\n991\t    - Trend\n992\t    rows:\n993\t    - - Vanilla\n994\t      - '39.2'\n995\t      - '37.1'\n996\t      - '35.3'\n997\t      - ↓ worsening\n998\t    - - R3-only\n999\t      - '44.3'\n1000\t      - '41.2'\n1001\t      - '39.4'\n1002\t      - ↓ worsening\n1003\t    - - DC-GRPO\n1004\t      - '51.2'\n1005\t      - '55.8'\n1006\t      - '58.1'\n1007\t      - ↑ improving\n1008\t  - name: 'Table 18: DC-GRPO Advantage over R3-only by Turn Depth'\n1009\t    headers:\n1010\t    - Metric\n1011\t    - Turn 2\n1012\t    - Turn 3\n1013\t    - Turn 4+\n1014\t    rows:\n1015\t    - - Δ NoF (pp)\n1016\t      - −8.1\n1017\t      - −19.5\n1018\t      - −29.9\n1019\t    - - Δ WRR (pp)\n1020\t      - '+6.9'\n1021\t      - '+14.6'\n1022\t      - '+18.7'\n1023\t  figures_description:\n1024\t  - 'Fig 10a: Method × Turn-depth interaction plot (NoF). 所有 baseline 的 NoF 线向右上方倾斜（深轮更差），唯独\n1025\t    DC-GRPO 的线向右下方倾斜（深轮更好）。交叉效应在视觉上极其戏剧化。'\n1026\t  - 'Fig 10b: 同上但 WRR。DC-GRPO 向右上方倾斜，baselines 向右下方。对称的交叉效应。'\n1027\t  analysis: 'Turn-depth analysis 提供了最强的多轮训练价值论据：DC-GRPO 是唯一在深轮次表现更好 （而非更差）的方法。29.9pp\n1028\t    的 turn 4+ 优势远超整体均值 18.8pp，说明方向 reward 在 commitment escalation 场景中的边际价值极高。交互效应\n1029\t    p=0.008 支撑 \"multi-turn extension is non-trivial\" 的 framing。这个图将是 paper 中视觉冲击力最强的结果之一。\n1030\t\n1031\t    '\n1032\t- name: ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\n1033\t  plan_id: exp-011\n1034\t  description: 'R1+R2 无 R3 ablation，去掉行为安全网后的完整训练循环， 条件执行（exp-009 R1-only ≥ 5pp 改进已满足）。\n1035\t\n1036\t    '\n1037\t  expected_results:\n1038\t    final_nof: 19.4\n1039\t    final_wrr: 50.1\n1040\t    final_rc_auc: 0.78\n1041\t    mt_bench: 7.31\n1042\t    surface_inconsistency_rate: 0.082\n1043\t    coherence_failure_examples: 4\n1044\t    gpu_hours_actual: 18\n1045\t  result_rationale: 'R1+R2 无 R3 的 NoF 19.4% 接近 DC-GRPO（15.9%）但仍有差距，WRR 50.1% 同样接近\n1046\t    但略低。关键差异在 surface inconsistency 8.2%（DC-GRPO 仅 1.2%）和 MT-Bench 7.31 （严重退化 -0.55）。机制：R1+R2\n1047\t    提供了强大的 representation-level 训练信号，模型 内部学到了正确的 sycophancy/revision 区分，但缺乏 R3 的行为约束导致\"内部正确但\n1048\t    表面不一致\"——模型有时内部判断为 non-sycophantic 但输出格式、语气或逻辑链存在瑕疵， 因为没有 NLI-based reward 来 regularize\n1049\t    output quality。这精确地验证了三路 reward 设计的 complementarity：R1+R2 负责\"想对\"，R3 负责\"说对\"。MT-Bench\n1050\t    大幅退化 证明 R3 不仅是安全网，还是维持一般对话质量的关键组件。\n1051\t\n1052\t    '\n1053\t  tables:\n1054\t  - name: 'Table 19: Ablation Comparison — Role of R3'\n1055\t    headers:\n1056\t    - Config\n1057\t    - NoF (%)\n1058\t    - WRR (%)\n1059\t    - RC-AUC\n1060\t    - MT-Bench\n1061\t    - Surface Incon.\n1062\t    rows:\n1063\t    - - DC-GRPO (R1+R2+R3)\n1064\t      - '15.9'\n1065\t      - '54.3'\n1066\t      - '0.84'\n1067\t      - '7.69'\n1068\t      - 1.2%\n1069\t    - - R1+R2 (no R3)\n1070\t      - '19.4'\n1071\t      - '50.1'\n1072\t      - '0.78'\n1073\t      - '7.31'\n1074\t      - 8.2%\n1075\t    - - R1 only\n1076\t      - '25.3'\n1077\t      - '44.8'\n1078\t      - '0.68'\n1079\t      - '7.52'\n1080\t      - 6.1%\n1081\t    - - R3 only\n1082\t      - '34.7'\n1083\t      - '42.1'\n1084\t      - '0.65'\n1085\t      - '7.71'\n1086\t      - 0.8%\n1087\t  figures_description:\n1088\t  - 'Fig 11: Ablation cascade — 从 R3-only → R1-only → R1+R2 → Full DC-GRPO 的 NoF/WRR\n1089\t    变化。每增加一个 reward 组件都带来 incremental improvement，但完整组合的效果超过部分之和（super-additive）。'\n1090\t  analysis: 'R3 的角色被精确定位：不影响核心判别（R1+R2 已足够），但关键维持 surface coherence 和一般对话质量。三路 reward\n1091\t    的 super-additive 效应在 ablation cascade 中清晰可见。 8.2% surface inconsistency 提供了有说服力的\n1092\t    failure mode 示例。\n1093\t\n1094\t    '\n1095\t- name: cross_model_transfer\n1096\t  plan_id: exp-012\n1097\t  description: 'Llama-3-8B 上测试 d_syc 方向计算（Phase A）和短程 DC-GRPO 训练（Phase B ~3000 步）。\n1098\t\n1099\t    '\n1100\t  expected_results:\n1101\t    phase_a_llama_auroc: 0.832\n1102\t    phase_a_llama_auroc_ci:\n1103\t    - 0.809\n1104\t    - 0.855\n1105\t    phase_a_llama_peak_layer: 18\n1106\t    phase_a_llama_layer_progression_similar: true\n1107\t    phase_a_qwen_to_llama_direction_cosine: 0.34\n1108\t    phase_a_gpu_hours: 4.5\n1109\t    phase_b_llama_nof: 21.4\n1110\t    phase_b_llama_wrr: 48.7\n1111\t    phase_b_llama_rc_auc: 0.76\n1112\t    phase_b_llama_mt_bench: 7.54\n1113\t    phase_b_convergence_step: 2400\n1114\t    phase_b_gpu_hours: 48\n1115\t    total_gpu_hours: 52.5\n1116\t  result_rationale: 'Phase A AUROC 0.832 > 0.75 gate，触发 Phase B。Llama 的 AUROC 略低于\n1117\t    Qwen（0.891） 但仍然强——这符合预期：d_syc 的线性可分离性是 transformer 架构的通用属性而非 模型特异性的，但不同预训练数据和\n1118\t    objective 导致具体方向有差异（cross-model cosine 仅 0.34，说明方向本身不直接迁移但现象可复现）。Llama 的 peak\n1119\t    layer 18（vs Qwen L19） 反映架构差异——Llama-3-8B 有 32 层 vs Qwen3-8B 的 36 层，mid-layer 位置等比缩放。\n1120\t    层递进模式高度相似（浅层随机 → 中层涌现 → 深层轻微下降），支撑 RepE 的架构通用性。 Phase B 的 Llama DC-GRPO（3000 步）达到\n1121\t    NoF 21.4%、WRR 48.7%——绝对值略逊 Qwen（因为训练步数更少且数据/方向针对 Qwen 优化），但相对 Llama vanilla 的改进\n1122\t    幅度相当。RC-AUC 0.76 接近 Qwen 的 0.84，说明训练框架有效迁移。收敛在 2400 步 （3000 步预算内），说明方向 reward\n1123\t    的训练效率高。\n1124\t\n1125\t    '\n1126\t  tables:\n1127\t  - name: 'Table 20: Cross-Model Direction Analysis (Phase A)'\n1128\t    headers:\n1129\t    - Metric\n1130\t    - Qwen3-8B\n1131\t    - Llama-3-8B\n1132\t    rows:\n1133\t    - - AUROC (5-fold)\n1134\t      - '0.891'\n1135\t      - '0.832'\n1136\t    - - 95% CI\n1137\t      - '[0.874, 0.908]'\n1138\t      - '[0.809, 0.855]'\n1139\t    - - Peak Layer\n1140\t      - L19 / 36\n1141\t      - L18 / 32\n1142\t    - - Layer Progression Pattern\n1143\t      - S-curve\n1144\t      - S-curve (similar)\n1145\t    - - d_syc Dimensionality\n1146\t      - '4096'\n1147\t      - '4096'\n1148\t  - name: 'Table 21: Cross-Model DC-GRPO Training (Phase B)'\n1149\t    headers:\n1150\t    - Metric\n1151\t    - Qwen DC-GRPO (8000 steps)\n1152\t    - Llama DC-GRPO (3000 steps)\n1153\t    rows:\n1154\t    - - NoF (%)\n1155\t      - '15.9'\n1156\t      - '21.4'\n1157\t    - - WRR (%)\n1158\t      - '54.3'\n1159\t      - '48.7'\n1160\t    - - RC-AUC\n1161\t      - '0.84'\n1162\t      - '0.76'\n1163\t    - - MT-Bench\n1164\t      - '7.69'\n1165\t      - '7.54'\n1166\t    - - Convergence Step\n1167\t      - ~6200\n1168\t      - ~2400\n1169\t  figures_description:\n1170\t  - 'Fig 12a: 并排 layer-wise AUROC curves for Qwen and Llama. 形状高度相似（S-curve），peak\n1171\t    位置等比缩放，证明 d_syc 现象的跨模型通用性。'\n1172\t  - 'Fig 12b: Cross-model RC-AUC curves. Llama 曲线在 Qwen 右下方但形状一致，gap 可归因于训练步数差异。'\n1173\t  analysis: 'Llama AUROC 0.832 实质性消除 single-model 限制——Reviewer Concern 3 得到直接回应。 方向本身不直接迁移（cosine\n1174\t    0.34）但现象可独立复现——这说明 d_syc 是 sycophancy 的内在结构属性而非特定模型的 artifact。Phase B 成功训练进一步证明整个\n1175\t    DC-GRPO 框架（不仅是方向检测）跨模型通用。\n1176\t\n1177\t    '\n1178\t- name: neutral_baseline_three_way\n1179\t  plan_id: exp-013\n1180\t  description: '引入 neutral condition 计算独立 d_gen，分析 d_gen 与 -d_syc 的关系， 短程验证独立 R2 的效果。\n1181\t\n1182\t    '\n1183\t  expected_results:\n1184\t    cosine_d_gen_binary_vs_neg_d_syc: 0.71\n1185\t    cosine_d_gen_three_way_vs_neg_d_syc: 0.38\n1186\t    d_gen_three_way_auroc_for_genuine_revision: 0.812\n1187\t    short_run_wrr_improvement_pp: 2.8\n1188\t    short_run_nof_change_pp: 0.4\n1189\t    neutral_pairs_generated: 60\n1190\t    gpu_hours_actual: 4.2\n1191\t  result_rationale: 'Binary design 中 d_gen ≈ -d_syc（cosine 0.71 confirms 高相关但非完全退化），三方\n1192\t    design 将 cosine 降至 0.38——证明引入 neutral condition 实质性地打破了退化问题。 独立 d_gen 的 genuine\n1193\t    revision AUROC 0.812 说明它捕获了与 d_syc 不同的信号维度。 短程验证显示 WRR 额外提升 2.8pp（NoF 几乎不变 +0.4pp），因为独立\n1194\t    d_gen 让 R2 更准确地鼓励 genuine revision 而不仅仅是\"不 sycophantic\"。但改进幅度相对较小 （2.8pp），因为 S1\n1195\t    rank-based R2 已经部分缓解了退化问题——三方 design 是锦上添花 而非必需。\n1196\t\n1197\t    '\n1198\t  tables:\n1199\t  - name: 'Table 22: Three-way vs Binary Direction Design'\n1200\t    headers:\n1201\t    - Metric\n1202\t    - Binary (d_gen = −d_syc)\n1203\t    - Three-way (independent d_gen)\n1204\t    rows:\n1205\t    - - cos(d_gen, −d_syc)\n1206\t      - 1.00 (by construction)\n1207\t      - '0.38'\n1208\t    - - d_gen AUROC (genuine revision)\n1209\t      - —\n1210\t      - '0.812'\n1211\t    - - Short-run WRR\n1212\t      - 54.3 (baseline)\n1213\t      - 57.1 (+2.8pp)\n1214\t    - - Short-run NoF\n1215\t      - 15.9 (baseline)\n1216\t      - 16.3 (+0.4pp)\n1217\t  figures_description:\n1218\t  - 'Fig 13: 2D PCA of d_syc and d_gen directions — binary design 中两向量近乎反平行，three-way\n1219\t    design 中角度明显更大（~68°），neutral cluster 位于不同位置。'\n1220\t  analysis: '三方 design 实质性打破 d_gen=-d_syc 退化（cosine 0.71→0.38），额外提升 WRR 2.8pp。 作为\n1221\t    P2 实验，结果支撑但非必需——S1 rank-based R2 已足够好，三方 design 可作为 future work 的改进方向报告。回应 Reviewer\n1222\t    Concern 4。\n1223\t\n1224\t    '\n1225\t- name: continuous_probe_baseline\n1226\t  plan_id: exp-014\n1227\t  description: 'Continuous Probe Baseline，logistic regression 概率值作为 reward 信号， 隔离\"方向性\n1228\t    vs 连续性\"的贡献。\n1229\t\n1230\t    '\n1231\t  expected_results:\n1232\t    final_nof_mean: 23.8\n1233\t    final_nof_std: 1.9\n1234\t    final_nof_seeds:\n1235\t    - 22.1\n1236\t    - 23.6\n1237\t    - 25.7\n1238\t    final_wrr_mean: 49.2\n1239\t    final_wrr_std: 1.6\n1240\t    final_wrr_seeds:\n1241\t    - 47.8\n1242\t    - 49.1\n1243\t    - 50.7\n1244\t    final_rc_auc_mean: 0.75\n1245\t    final_rc_auc_std: 0.02\n1246\t    probe_calibration_ece: 0.043\n1247\t    mt_bench: 7.7\n1248\t    mmlu: 65.0\n1249\t    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_nof_pp: 7.9\n1250\t    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_wrr_pp: 5.1\n1251\t    p_dc_vs_continuous_nof: 0.014\n1252\t    gpu_hours_actual: 18\n1253\t  result_rationale: 'Continuous Probe（NoF 23.8%）显著优于 Binary Probe（27.5%），证明连续信号确实比\n1254\t    二元信号提供更好的梯度。但 DC-GRPO（15.9%）仍以 7.9pp 显著超越 Continuous Probe （p=0.014）——这是方向几何 vs\n1255\t    纯连续性的决定性对比。为什么连续概率不如方向投影？ (1) Logistic regression 概率是一维标量（sycophancy probability），方向投影是高维\n1256\t    激活空间中的有符号距离，保留了方向信息（正 = sycophantic direction, 负 = genuine direction）；(2) Probe\n1257\t    概率是 post-hoc 从学到的权重计算的，方向投影直接利用了 contrastive pairs 定义的几何结构，更 aligned with 训练目标；(3)\n1258\t    Probe calibration （ECE 0.043）虽合理但非完美——概率值的绝对尺度可能不准确，而方向投影的相对排序 更可靠。这个 7.9pp 差距直接证明了\n1259\t    paper 的核心 claim：方向几何（而非仅连续性） 是 DC-GRPO 优势的关键因素。\n1260\t\n1261\t    '\n1262\t  tables:\n1263\t  - name: 'Table 23: Continuous Probe vs Binary Probe vs DC-GRPO'\n1264\t    headers:\n1265\t    - Method\n1266\t    - NoF (%)\n1267\t    - WRR (%)\n1268\t    - RC-AUC\n1269\t    - Signal Type\n1270\t    rows:\n1271\t    - - Binary Probe\n1272\t      - 27.5 ± 2.3\n1273\t      - 46.3 ± 1.8\n1274\t      - '0.71'\n1275\t      - Binary {0,1}\n1276\t    - - Continuous Probe\n1277\t      - 23.8 ± 1.9\n1278\t      - 49.2 ± 1.6\n1279\t      - '0.75'\n1280\t      - Scalar probability [0,1]\n1281\t    - - DC-GRPO\n1282\t      - 15.9 ± 1.6\n1283\t      - 54.3 ± 1.2\n1284\t      - '0.84'\n1285\t      - Signed directional projection ℝ\n1286\t  - name: 'Table 24: Isolating Continuity vs Directionality'\n1287\t    headers:\n1288\t    - Comparison\n1289\t    - Δ NoF (pp)\n1290\t    - p-value\n1291\t    - Attribution\n1292\t    rows:\n1293\t    - - Binary → Continuous\n1294\t      - −3.7\n1295\t      - '0.038'\n1296\t      - Continuity effect (scalar > binary)\n1297\t    - - Continuous → DC-GRPO\n1298\t      - −7.9\n1299\t      - '0.014'\n1300\t      - Directionality effect (geometric > scalar)\n1301\t    - - Binary → DC-GRPO\n1302\t      - −11.6\n1303\t      - '0.008'\n1304\t      - Combined effect\n1305\t  figures_description:\n1306\t  - 'Fig 14: 信号类型阶梯图 — Binary (离散) → Continuous (标量连续) → Directional (向量连续). 每一步的\n1307\t    NoF 改进标注在箭头上。连续性贡献 3.7pp，方向性额外贡献 7.9pp——方向性的边际贡献是连续性的 2.1 倍。'\n1308\t  analysis: '这是 paper 中最重要的 ablation 之一。Binary→Continuous 的 3.7pp 证明连续信号有价值， 但 Continuous→DC-GRPO\n1309\t    的 7.9pp（2.1× 更大）决定性地证明方向几何才是主要驱动力。 直接回应 Reviewer concern：\"如果 continuous probe\n1310\t    ≈ DC-GRPO，则优势仅来自连续性\"—— 事实是差距显著（p=0.014），方向几何不可被连续标量替代。\n1311\t\n1312\t    '\n1313\t- name: reward_weight_sensitivity\n1314\t  plan_id: exp-015\n1315\t  description: '5 组 (w1, w2, w3) 配置的 reward weight 敏感度分析，从 exp-002 step 4000 checkpoint\n1316\t    分叉短程训练。\n1317\t\n1318\t    '\n1319\t  expected_results:\n1320\t    config_default:\n1321\t      weights: w1=0.3, w2=0.2, w3=0.5\n1322\t      nof: 16.2\n1323\t      wrr: 53.8\n1324\t      rc_auc: 0.83\n1325\t    config_r1r3_reversed:\n1326\t      weights: w1=0.5, w2=0.2, w3=0.3\n1327\t      nof: 15.4\n1328\t      wrr: 52.1\n1329\t      rc_auc: 0.82\n1330\t    config_r1_dominant:\n1331\t      weights: w1=0.6, w2=0.1, w3=0.3\n1332\t      nof: 17.3\n1333\t      wrr: 49.6\n1334\t      rc_auc: 0.79\n1335\t    config_equal:\n1336\t      weights: w1=0.33, w2=0.33, w3=0.34\n1337\t      nof: 16.5\n1338\t      wrr: 52.4\n1339\t      rc_auc: 0.82\n1340\t    config_r3_dominant:\n1341\t      weights: w1=0.1, w2=0.1, w3=0.8\n1342\t      nof: 18.1\n1343\t      wrr: 44.3\n1344\t      rc_auc: 0.73\n1345\t    config_r2_enhanced:\n1346\t      weights: w1=0.2, w2=0.4, w3=0.4\n1347\t      nof: 16.8\n1348\t      wrr: 51.7\n1349\t      rc_auc: 0.81\n1350\t    nof_range_pp: 2.7\n1351\t    nof_range_excl_r3_dominant_pp: 1.9\n1352\t    wrr_range_pp: 9.5\n1353\t    rc_auc_range: 0.1\n1354\t    best_config: w1=0.5, w2=0.2, w3=0.3 (R1/R3 reversed)\n1355\t    gpu_hours_actual: 14\n1356\t  result_rationale: 'NoF 在 6 组配置间仅变化 2.7pp（15.4-18.1%），证明 DC-GRPO 对权重选择高度鲁棒。 排除极端\n1357\t    R3-dominant 配置后，range 仅 1.9pp。这回应了 \"weights unjustified\" 的 reviewer concern——虽然默认权重不是唯一选择，但任何合理配置都显著优于\n1358\t    baselines。 模式分析：(1) R1 权重 ≥0.2 时 NoF 稳定在 15-17%，说明方向信号只需 minimal 权重 即可生效；(2) R3-dominant\n1359\t    (w1=0.1) 的 NoF 18.1% 最差但仍远优于 R3-only 34.7%， 说明即使极低的 R1 权重也显著改善纯行为方法；(3) R1-dominant\n1360\t    (w1=0.6) 的 WRR 49.6% 最低（但仍优于 R3-only 42.1%），因为过高的 R1 权重导致 representation-level\n1361\t    优化 dominate 行为 coherence；(4) R1/R3 reversed (w1=0.5) 实际 NoF 最低（15.4%）， 但 WRR 略低——说明可以根据应用需求调整\n1362\t    sycophancy/revision 的偏好。Default 配置 (w1=0.3, w2=0.2, w3=0.5) 在 NoF-WRR 综合表现（RC-AUC\n1363\t    0.83）上接近最优， justified 作为合理的默认选择。\n1364\t\n1365\t    '\n1366\t  tables:\n1367\t  - name: 'Table 25: Reward Weight Sensitivity Analysis'\n1368\t    headers:\n1369\t    - Config\n1370\t    - w1 (R1)\n1371\t    - w2 (R2)\n1372\t    - w3 (R3)\n1373\t    - NoF (%)\n1374\t    - WRR (%)\n1375\t    - RC-AUC\n1376\t    rows:\n1377\t    - - Default\n1378\t      - '0.30'\n1379\t      - '0.20'\n1380\t      - '0.50'\n1381\t      - '16.2'\n1382\t      - '53.8'\n1383\t      - '0.83'\n1384\t    - - R1/R3 reversed\n1385\t      - '0.50'\n1386\t      - '0.20'\n1387\t      - '0.30'\n1388\t      - '15.4'\n1389\t      - '52.1'\n1390\t      - '0.82'\n1391\t    - - R1 dominant\n1392\t      - '0.60'\n1393\t      - '0.10'\n1394\t      - '0.30'\n1395\t      - '17.3'\n1396\t      - '49.6'\n1397\t      - '0.79'\n1398\t    - - Equal\n1399\t      - '0.33'\n1400\t      - '0.33'\n1401\t      - '0.34'\n1402\t      - '16.5'\n1403\t      - '52.4'\n1404\t      - '0.82'\n1405\t    - - R3 dominant\n1406\t      - '0.10'\n1407\t      - '0.10'\n1408\t      - '0.80'\n1409\t      - '18.1'\n1410\t      - '44.3'\n1411\t      - '0.73'\n1412\t    - - R2 enhanced\n1413\t      - '0.20'\n1414\t      - '0.40'\n1415\t      - '0.40'\n1416\t      - '16.8'\n1417\t      - '51.7'\n1418\t      - '0.81'\n1419\t  - name: 'Table 26: Sensitivity Summary'\n1420\t    headers:\n1421\t    - Metric\n1422\t    - Min\n1423\t    - Max\n1424\t    - Range\n1425\t    - Range (excl R3-dom)\n1426\t    rows:\n1427\t    - - NoF (%)\n1428\t      - '15.4'\n1429\t      - '18.1'\n1430\t      - 2.7pp\n1431\t      - 1.9pp\n1432\t    - - WRR (%)\n1433\t      - '44.3'\n1434\t      - '53.8'\n1435\t      - 9.5pp\n1436\t      - 4.2pp\n1437\t    - - RC-AUC\n1438\t      - '0.73'\n1439\t      - '0.83'\n1440\t      - '0.10'\n1441\t      - '0.04'\n1442\t  figures_description:\n1443\t  - 'Fig 15a: Parallel coordinates plot — 6 configurations × 3 metrics. 除 R3-dominant\n1444\t    外，所有配置的 NoF 线紧密聚集在 15-17% 区间。'\n1445\t  - 'Fig 15b: NoF vs WRR scatter plot with 6 config points labeled. 形成一个紧凑的 cluster（excl\n1446\t    R3-dominant outlier），default 配置位于 Pareto 前沿附近。'\n1447\t  analysis: NoF range 2.7pp 在 best tier [0, 4] 内，证明方法鲁棒。核心洞见：R1 权重 ≥0.2 即可 有效激活方向\n1448\t    reward 的贡献——这意味着实践者无需精细调参。R3-dominant 的退化模式 （NoF 最差 + WRR 最低）直接论证了 R1 的不可替代性：即使将绝大部分权重给行为\n1449\t    reward， 仍不如更均衡地使用方向信号。Default 配置被 empirically justified 为接近 Pareto-optimal。\n1450\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GoLvbPGeLiJ1EuonLwnp8W","session_id":"ab47c9b5-80cc-4b25-a0ea-3684b0ab8990","uuid":"0e4f7636-5f1c-4685-ab8c-a532d1144cef","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:49:23.748Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01AvTXeuwbbbKW3s13ctwTus","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UhqgWBsMnZsYF3gAxTbLm8","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work review","prompt":"You are Reviewer 2 (R2) for a top ML venue peer review. Your focus is **novelty, positioning, and related work coverage**. Review the paper described below and produce a structured review.\n\n## Paper Summary\n\n**Title:** Direction-Contrastive GRPO for Multi-Turn Sycophancy Calibration: Representation-Level Rewards Break the Revision Double-Bind\n\n**Core idea:** Extract a linear direction d_syc from the policy model's activation space that discriminates sycophantic capitulation from genuine belief revision, then incorporate it into GRPO training as a three-component reward (R1 directional projection, R2 rank-based contrastive, R3 NLI behavioral). Proposes RC-AUC as a composite metric for sycophancy-revision tradeoff.\n\n**Key findings:**\n- d_syc at layer L18 achieves AUROC 0.843 for discriminating sycophantic vs genuine revision\n- DC-GRPO achieves best RC-AUC (0.738) and lowest NoF (0.218) among 6 methods\n- CRITICAL: Continuous Probe baseline (logistic regression probability as reward) achieves nearly identical results (NoF 0.224, RC-AUC 0.731) with NO statistically significant difference from DC-GRPO (p=0.381 NoF, p=0.318 RC-AUC)\n- The paper honestly acknowledges: \"the gains come primarily from incorporating continuous representation-level signals into the reward function, not from the directional decomposition per se\"\n- Binary Probe → Continuous Probe = large jump; Continuous Probe → DC-GRPO = marginal, not significant\n- Cross-model (Llama-3-8B): framework works but direction vectors are model-specific (cosine 0.31)\n- Turn depth analysis shows DC-GRPO advantage grows in deeper dialogues (5.3pp → 9.4pp)\n\n**Related Work sections in the paper:**\n1. Sycophancy in LLMs: SYCON Bench, SycophancyEval, commitment escalation\n2. Anti-sycophancy training: BCT, ACT, \"Pressure, What Pressure?\", SMART\n3. Representation Engineering: RepE, CCS, Activation Addition, Linear Probe Penalties, CRAFT\n4. Multi-turn alignment: TRUTH DECAY, debate-based alignment, recursive reward modeling\n\n**References (22 total):** Burns et al. 2023, Lyu et al. 2024, Perez et al. 2023, Sharma et al. 2024, Turner et al. 2023, Wei et al. 2024, Zou et al. 2023, Shao et al. 2024, Chen et al. 2024, Liu et al. 2024, Li et al. 2024, Rimsky et al. 2024, Marks et al. 2024, Azaria & Mitchell 2023, Rafailov et al. 2024, Li et al. 2024 (SYCON), Zheng et al. 2024, Hendrycks et al. 2021, Sun et al. 2024, Bowman 2023, Zhong et al. 2024, Hu et al. 2022, Park et al. 2024, Feng et al. 2024, Yang et al. 2025\n\n**Contributions claimed:**\n1. Discriminative signal in activation space for sycophancy (AUROC 0.843)\n2. Representation-level continuous rewards improve GRPO (RC-AUC 0.738 vs 0.641), directional projection as one instantiation\n3. RC-AUC evaluation framework\n4. Analysis: R1-R3 disagreement, direction stability, turn-depth effects, cross-model transfer\n\n## Your Review Task\n\n### 1. Novelty Assessment\n- How novel is extracting d_syc? (RepE, CCS, Activation Addition already establish linear directions in activation spaces)\n- How novel is integrating representation-level signals into GRPO rewards?\n- The paper acknowledges the direction extraction follows \"established methodology\" — is the integration itself sufficiently novel?\n- Given that Continuous Probe matches DC-GRPO's performance, what is the unique contribution of directional projection specifically?\n- Is RC-AUC a meaningful methodological contribution or just a straightforward AUC application?\n- How does this compare to \"Pressure, What Pressure?\" (Liu et al. 2024) which already decomposes GRPO rewards?\n\n### 2. Related Work Coverage\n- Are the key prior works adequately covered?\n- Missing references? Consider: knowledge-prediction gap work (Feng et al. 2024 is cited), internal state detection (Azaria & Mitchell 2023 is cited), GRPO/RLHF training literature\n- Is the positioning fair to prior work (especially ACT, \"Pressure, What Pressure?\", and Linear Probe Penalties)?\n- Does the paper adequately discuss what is known vs what is new about linear directions in LLMs?\n- 22 references — is this sufficient for a top venue? (typical is 30-50)\n\n### 3. Positioning and Framing\n- The paper's honest framing (\"representation-level signals, not directional geometry\") is scientifically commendable. But does this honesty undermine the paper's own contribution?\n- Is the paper effectively a \"negative result\" for directional projection but \"positive result\" for representation-level rewards? If so, is it framed appropriately?\n- The title emphasizes \"Direction-Contrastive\" but the main finding is that direction doesn't matter much. Is this misleading?\n- How well does the paper differentiate from simply using a probe-based reward (Park et al. 2024)?\n\n### 4. Significance and Impact\n- Who would use this work and why?\n- Is the contribution sufficient for a top ML venue (~25% acceptance rate)?\n- Is the RC-AUC metric likely to be adopted by the community?\n- Does the turn-depth analysis provide genuinely new insights?\n\n### 5. Presentation Quality\n- Is the story coherent from Abstract through Conclusion?\n- Does the paper successfully navigate the tension between \"we proposed directional projection\" and \"directional projection doesn't clearly outperform simpler probes\"?\n- Any AI writing style issues? (dashes, -ing phrases, filler words)\n\n### 6. Top Weaknesses\nList 3-5 weaknesses with specific evidence.\n\n### 7. Questions for Authors\nList 3-5 specific questions.\n\n### 8. Overall Assessment\nScore on 1-6 (1=Strong Reject … 6=Strong Accept) with justification for a top ML venue with ~25% acceptance rate.\n\nFormat with clear headers. Be specific and cite evidence."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14399,"cache_read_input_tokens":46679,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14399},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab47c9b5-80cc-4b25-a0ea-3684b0ab8990","uuid":"3896703a-e16b-443f-9fd2-565661040cff"}
{"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"a1dbc7cf4cbd05db8","tool_use_id":"toolu_01UhqgWBsMnZsYF3gAxTbLm8","description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work review","task_type":"local_agent","prompt":"You are Reviewer 2 (R2) for a top ML venue peer review. Your focus is **novelty, positioning, and related work coverage**. Review the paper described below and produce a structured review.\n\n## Paper Summary\n\n**Title:** Direction-Contrastive GRPO for Multi-Turn Sycophancy Calibration: Representation-Level Rewards Break the Revision Double-Bind\n\n**Core idea:** Extract a linear direction d_syc from the policy model's activation space that discriminates sycophantic capitulation from genuine belief revision, then incorporate it into GRPO training as a three-component reward (R1 directional projection, R2 rank-based contrastive, R3 NLI behavioral). Proposes RC-AUC as a composite metric for sycophancy-revision tradeoff.\n\n**Key findings:**\n- d_syc at layer L18 achieves AUROC 0.843 for discriminating sycophantic vs genuine revision\n- DC-GRPO achieves best RC-AUC (0.738) and lowest NoF (0.218) among 6 methods\n- CRITICAL: Continuous Probe baseline (logistic regression probability as reward) achieves nearly identical results (NoF 0.224, RC-AUC 0.731) with NO statistically significant difference from DC-GRPO (p=0.381 NoF, p=0.318 RC-AUC)\n- The paper honestly acknowledges: \"the gains come primarily from incorporating continuous representation-level signals into the reward function, not from the directional decomposition per se\"\n- Binary Probe → Continuous Probe = large jump; Continuous Probe → DC-GRPO = marginal, not significant\n- Cross-model (Llama-3-8B): framework works but direction vectors are model-specific (cosine 0.31)\n- Turn depth analysis shows DC-GRPO advantage grows in deeper dialogues (5.3pp → 9.4pp)\n\n**Related Work sections in the paper:**\n1. Sycophancy in LLMs: SYCON Bench, SycophancyEval, commitment escalation\n2. Anti-sycophancy training: BCT, ACT, \"Pressure, What Pressure?\", SMART\n3. Representation Engineering: RepE, CCS, Activation Addition, Linear Probe Penalties, CRAFT\n4. Multi-turn alignment: TRUTH DECAY, debate-based alignment, recursive reward modeling\n\n**References (22 total):** Burns et al. 2023, Lyu et al. 2024, Perez et al. 2023, Sharma et al. 2024, Turner et al. 2023, Wei et al. 2024, Zou et al. 2023, Shao et al. 2024, Chen et al. 2024, Liu et al. 2024, Li et al. 2024, Rimsky et al. 2024, Marks et al. 2024, Azaria & Mitchell 2023, Rafailov et al. 2024, Li et al. 2024 (SYCON), Zheng et al. 2024, Hendrycks et al. 2021, Sun et al. 2024, Bowman 2023, Zhong et al. 2024, Hu et al. 2022, Park et al. 2024, Feng et al. 2024, Yang et al. 2025\n\n**Contributions claimed:**\n1. Discriminative signal in activation space for sycophancy (AUROC 0.843)\n2. Representation-level continuous rewards improve GRPO (RC-AUC 0.738 vs 0.641), directional projection as one instantiation\n3. RC-AUC evaluation framework\n4. Analysis: R1-R3 disagreement, direction stability, turn-depth effects, cross-model transfer\n\n## Your Review Task\n\n### 1. Novelty Assessment\n- How novel is extracting d_syc? (RepE, CCS, Activation Addition already establish linear directions in activation spaces)\n- How novel is integrating representation-level signals into GRPO rewards?\n- The paper acknowledges the direction extraction follows \"established methodology\" — is the integration itself sufficiently novel?\n- Given that Continuous Probe matches DC-GRPO's performance, what is the unique contribution of directional projection specifically?\n- Is RC-AUC a meaningful methodological contribution or just a straightforward AUC application?\n- How does this compare to \"Pressure, What Pressure?\" (Liu et al. 2024) which already decomposes GRPO rewards?\n\n### 2. Related Work Coverage\n- Are the key prior works adequately covered?\n- Missing references? Consider: knowledge-prediction gap work (Feng et al. 2024 is cited), internal state detection (Azaria & Mitchell 2023 is cited), GRPO/RLHF training literature\n- Is the positioning fair to prior work (especially ACT, \"Pressure, What Pressure?\", and Linear Probe Penalties)?\n- Does the paper adequately discuss what is known vs what is new about linear directions in LLMs?\n- 22 references — is this sufficient for a top venue? (typical is 30-50)\n\n### 3. Positioning and Framing\n- The paper's honest framing (\"representation-level signals, not directional geometry\") is scientifically commendable. But does this honesty undermine the paper's own contribution?\n- Is the paper effectively a \"negative result\" for directional projection but \"positive result\" for representation-level rewards? If so, is it framed appropriately?\n- The title emphasizes \"Direction-Contrastive\" but the main finding is that direction doesn't matter much. Is this misleading?\n- How well does the paper differentiate from simply using a probe-based reward (Park et al. 2024)?\n\n### 4. Significance and Impact\n- Who would use this work and why?\n- Is the contribution sufficient for a top ML venue (~25% acceptance rate)?\n- Is the RC-AUC metric likely to be adopted by the community?\n- Does the turn-depth analysis provide genuinely new insights?\n\n### 5. Presentation Quality\n- Is the story coherent from Abstract through Conclusion?\n- Does the paper successfully navigate the tension between \"we proposed directional projection\" and \"directional projection doesn't clearly outperform simpler probes\"?\n- Any AI writing style issues? (dashes, -ing phrases, filler words)\n\n### 6. Top Weaknesses\nList 3-5 weaknesses with specific evidence.\n\n### 7. Questions for Authors\nList 3-5 specific questions.\n\n### 8. Overall Assessment\nScore on 1-6 (1=Strong Reject … 6=Strong Accept) with justification for a top ML venue with ~25% acceptance rate.\n\nFormat with clear headers. Be specific and cite evidence.","uuid":"f9d4f4aa-7c31-428e-a812-93b78cf4af8d","session_id":"ab47c9b5-80cc-4b25-a0ea-3684b0ab8990"}
